(text "HALL1..4 and FLEX_FREQ use EXTI14/15/0/7/8. DIN5..8 are POLLED, no EXTI reservations.\nInput low/high thresholds, cable faults, power-off rail injection and flex frequency timing are not qualified.\nEvery active channel inverts. Optional open-drain pullups remain DNP until actual sensor models are known." (at 25.4 370 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2932882b-4106-5fe9-8345-a746e9eb233d"))
